        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "**All in all**, two thirds want to cut down permanently, but almost nobody wants to quit completely. Their tips: limit screen time, turn off notifications, and put the phone away one hour before bed. The main lesson? It is not the phone that is the problem, but uncontrolled use. What do you think — could you survive one detox week?",
