        "text": "| **Mobile Concurrency** | Mobile Konkurrenz der Zeitebenen | 表现主义时空交织舞台手法 | Fluid blending of past memories, guilt hallucinations, and present reality directly on stage. | 舞台布景分析中的王牌专业术语 |",
