        "kind": "p",
        "text": "| 4 | \"with that person's cheerful consent\" / \"a delicious irony that we call this stream a 'feed', a word that once meant care … What is fed here is not the reader.\" | **Ironie**（+ Wortspiel feed = füttern / Feed） | 读者先笑后醒：越是「自愿」越显得荒诞；\"feed\" 的词义反差把「被喂养」翻转为「被吞食」，刺痛感最强。 |  *Die Ironie demaskiert die Zustimmung als Teil des Problems, nicht als Rechtfertigung.*<br> *The irony of the word \"feed\" exposes the gap between what the technology promises — care — and what it does — consumption.* |",
