        "text": "| 6 | \"The feed never sleeps; it hunts, it learns, it waits.\" | **Personifikation**（+ Tricholon） | 让算法成为有意志的猎手，读者从「使用者」变成「猎物」，被动感与不安感同时上升。 |  *Die Personifikation macht den Algorithmus zum Jäger und den Nutzer zur Beute.*<br> *By personifying the feed as a hunter, the author reverses the roles: the user is no longer a customer but the prey.* |",
