        "text": "| 9 | \"The first act of resistance is embarrassingly modest: to notice.\" / \"stop treating it as spare change\" | **Appell**（impliziter Imperativ + Direktadressierung \"you\"/\"we\"） | 把宏大问题缩小为「你可做到的一件小事」，读者从无力感转为可行动，收尾有正面推力。 |  *Der Appell am Schluss überführt die Analyse in eine Handlungsaufforderung und bindet den Leser ein.*<br> *The final appeal translates the analysis into a doable action, leaving the reader with a sense of agency rather than resignation.* |",
