        "text": "1. **a)** $U_\\text{ind} = L\\dfrac{\\Delta I}{\\Delta t} = 0{,}50\\cdot\\dfrac{2{,}0}{0{,}20} = 5{,}0\\,\\text{V}$  **得分点：式 + 代入 + 单位**",
