        "kind": "p",
        "text": "3. **c) 速度**：能量守恒 $\\tfrac12 kA^2=\\tfrac12mv_{\\max}^2$ → $v_{\\max}=A\\sqrt{k/m}=0{,}040\\cdot6{,}3\\approx0{,}25\\,\\text{m/s}$  **得分点：能量式 + 数值**（AFB II）",
